.TH OSHOTPM 1 "2026-10-14" "oshot" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
oshotpm \- plugin manager for oshot
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B oshotpm
.RI [ "GLOBAL OPTIONS" ]...
.I COMMAND
.RI [ OPTIONS ]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B oshotpm
installs, updates and removes plugin repositories for
.BR oshot (1).
A repository is a Git repository or a local directory with plugins and an
\fIoshot\-plugin.toml\fR manifest.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BI help " COMMAND"
Show the help for \fICOMMAND\fR (\fBinstall\fR or \fBlist\fR).
.TP
.BR install " [\fB\-f\fR|\fB\-\-force\fR] \fIREPO\fR..."
Install the plugin repositories at the given Git URLs or local paths.
\fB\-\-force\fR installs them even if they are already installed.
.TP
.BI uninstall " REPO" ...
Uninstall the given installed repositories.
.TP
.BI enable " REPO/PLUGIN" ...
Enable plugins from installed repositories.
.TP
.BI disable " REPO/PLUGIN" ...
Disable plugins from installed repositories.
.TP
.BR list " [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]"
List the installed plugins.
.TP
.B update
Update all installed repositories.
.TP
.B gen\-manifest
Generate a template manifest.
.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print the help and exit.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print the version and other information about the build.
.TP
.BR \-D ", " \-\-dialogs
Show errors and prompts in GUI dialogs.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/oshot/plugins/
Installed plugins and their config.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
oshotpm install https://github.com/Toni500github/oshot-test-plugins
oshotpm disable toni-test/plugins
oshotpm uninstall tonis-plugins
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR oshot (1)
